<section id="slcBranding" class="section-content section-margin article-text">
    <article class="gap-v gap-h">
        <h2>Branding</h2>
        <h3>Color</h3>
        <p>Based on my research, most environment-based companies chose green or blue as their brand color. I knew that
            I wanted to stray away from that, so I chose yellow. Yellow is a light, fun, and cheerful color, but also is
            a very hopeful color. For my secondary colors, I brought back the green palette to keep the
            environmentally-conscious message within the brand.</p>
        <div class="color-palette-group gap-v gap-h">
