        <h3>Typography</h3>
        <p>For the typeface of Second Life, I wanted to emphasize the friendliness of the brand through an accessible
            and legible typeface. For its approachability and rounded corners, I chose the Poppins typeface. To ensure a
            base level of accessibility, most color and text color combinations meet WCAG AAA standards, with the
            stragglers meeting AA at an absolute minimum.</p>
        <div class="case-study-typography gap-v gap-h padding-tb padding-lr elevation-5">
            <ul class="case-study-typography-font-title elevation-1">
                <li class="poppins-font">
