        <h3>Logo</h3>
        <p>The logo is a mix of compressed, regular, and expanded fonts of Akzidenz-Grotesk Pro. I aimed to give the
            logo an off-kilter rhythm since most organic things tend to have their own rhythm and patterns.</p>
